    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.35",
    "order": 292,
    "anchor": "24.35",
    "summary": "In this unit's Normal, Advance and **Fall Back moves**:\n\n- Its models can move through other models except **TITANIC** ones, and horizontally through **terrain feature** sections 4″ high or less.\n- Before it moves, you may give all its models **MOBILE** until the move is over; if so, roll 1 D6 at its end, and on a 1 the unit is **Battle-shocked**.\n\n**MOBILE** lets it cross dense terrain horizontally; see [Terrain and Movement](vsdata:core-rule/terrain-and-movement).",
